#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:3
#: 9c708aa19026435fae04a54625e9a68f
msgid "随机掺杂（Random Doping）"
msgstr "Random Doping"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:5
#: f732da3205c144e7a0b07f0eeac50266
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "**Category:** Alloys and composition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:7
#: ea761971955f4dd78ba3f1c314bb21c0
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:9
#: fca00d1fa07a49c8a12c91f0cedb2dbb
#
msgid ""
"按一条或多条规则，把指定元素的部分位点替换为掺杂元素。每条规则回答四个问题：替换哪种元素、是否只处理特定 "
"`group`、替换成什么元素、替换多少个。它适合构造低浓度或局部分组掺杂；若要按一个整体目标组成重新分配全部位点，应使用 `随机占位`。"
msgstr ""
"Use one or more rules to replace some sites of a specified element with "
"dopants. Each rule answers four questions: which element to replace, "
"whether to restrict the operation to particular `group` labels, which "
"dopant elements to use, and how many sites to replace. It is suited to "
"low-concentration or locally grouped doping. Use `Random Occupancy` to "
"redistribute all sites according to one overall target composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:11
#: d2375ca42c214152af2ea5e6e7286e84
msgid "规则从上到下作用于同一份当前结构。前一条规则改变的元素可能成为后一条规则的候选，因此具有依赖关系的规则必须按预期顺序排列。"
msgstr ""
"Rules act from top to bottom on the same evolving structure. An element "
"produced by an earlier rule may become a candidate for a later rule, so "
"dependent rules must be ordered intentionally."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:13
#: dfb719bd40c942c3b83d0745f0360b6d
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:15
#: 57b3bf6c37b14928bcb8e131e1c2f249
msgid "设某条规则当前有 $N$ 个候选位点。"
msgstr "Suppose a rule currently has $N$ candidate sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:17
#: ce49ac560bc24f78857cac01d57086f8
msgid "使用原子百分比 $p$ 时，替换数为"
msgstr "With atomic percentage $p$, the replacement count is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:19
#: 2a60a6b0306645098ac098824d3f73d5
msgid ""
"\n"
"n=\\lfloor Np/100\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:23
#: de137931de294164be27e2ded5c391f5
msgid ""
"百分比填写为区间时，每个输出先在区间内均匀抽取一个百分比，再向下取整。小结构上的低百分比可能始终得到 $n=0$；如果整套规则的最大可能替换数仍为"
" 0，卡片会在运行前报错并建议提高用量或扩大结构。"
msgstr ""
"When a percentage range is entered, every output first samples a "
"percentage uniformly within that range, then rounds down. A low "
"percentage in a small structure may always give $n=0$. If the maximum "
"possible replacement count across the entire rule set is still zero, the "
"card reports an error before running and suggests increasing the amount "
"or enlarging the structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:25
#: fd8f811174254625be691732875934c2
msgid "“质量预算 %”沿用已有 `mass_percent` 数据语义：先把百分比乘以候选目标原子的原始总质量，再除以掺杂元素的平均原子质量："
msgstr ""
"`Mass budget %` retains the existing `mass_percent` data semantics: "
"multiply the percentage by the original total mass of candidate target "
"atoms, then divide by the mean atomic mass of the dopants:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:27
#: c773c6e5dda742ec911e805665a5b74a
msgid ""
"\n"
"n=\\left\\lfloor\n"
"\\frac{(p/100)N M_\\mathrm{target}}{\\bar M_\\mathrm{dopant}}\n"
"\\right\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:33
#: adbfb6cca8f84ee9a02a40b5ce442189
msgid "它表示相对于原目标原子质量的替换预算，不是输出结构的最终质量分数。实际结果应从输出元素和 metadata 重新统计。"
msgstr ""
"This is a replacement budget relative to the original mass of the target "
"atoms, not the final mass fraction of the output structure. Recalculate "
"the realized result from output species and metadata."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:35
#: a02b57a48c4f444d888893ad67d7c39f
msgid "替换总数确定后，“掺杂元素分配”只决定多种掺杂元素如何分享这 $n$ 个位点："
msgstr ""
"After the total replacement count is determined, `Dopant allocation` "
"decides only how multiple dopant elements share these $n$ sites:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:37
#: 8d45e8334ea2422d97b6e7233ace1c15
msgid "`Random`：每个位点按权重独立抽样，实际元素计数允许波动；"
msgstr ""
"`Random`: independently sample the element at each site according to its "
"weight, allowing realized element counts to fluctuate;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:38
#: 2a105b3f1f2e49fabd002b47c52e21bb
msgid "`Exact`：使用最大余数法得到最近可行的整数计数，再随机打乱落点。"
msgstr ""
"`Exact`: use the largest-remainder method to obtain the nearest feasible "
"integer counts, then randomly shuffle their placement."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:40
#: 6bb7d4e2e1e04acbaf4a8bc4bbdd8693
msgid "若掺杂权重采用质量比 $w_e$，程序先换算为原子抽样概率"
msgstr ""
"If dopant weights are mass ratios $w_e$, the program first converts them "
"to atomic sampling probabilities:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:42
#: c5d6104e213c4ed7a6b6353d90d86c0e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"q_e=\\frac{w_e/M_e}{\\sum_j w_j/M_j}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:46
#: 87dfada8b04146459f2ce1eb4a9884cf
msgid "因此顶层 `Random / Exact` 不改变替换位点总数，只改变 Ge/C 等多种掺杂元素之间的分配。"
msgstr ""
"Thus, the top-level `Random / Exact` choice does not change the total "
"number of replaced sites. It changes only how those sites are allocated "
"among multiple dopants such as Ge and C."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:48
#: 8fff16ba39a14f2db34ef8227f0596ca
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:50
#: 333505c3a6b746e98e452bd17883ba72
msgid "补充 Si–Ge 局域环境"
msgstr "Add Si–Ge Local Environments"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:52
#: 25d3874e60694a97ba3ae2460a73cbd3
msgid "若模型只在纯 Si 结构上训练，Si 位点被 Ge 替换后的局域化学环境没有覆盖。可输入含 64 个 Si 位点的超胞，添加规则："
msgstr ""
"If a model was trained only on pure Si structures, it has not covered the"
" local chemical environments created when Ge replaces Si sites. Provide a"
" supercell containing 64 Si sites and add this rule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:54
#: a4a0f47ff76a42709b05869dec5ba98a
msgid "替换元素：`Si`"
msgstr "Target element: `Si`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:55
#: a71d6bf8f9c9466ab6dd38ffa74bf644
msgid "替换为：`Ge`"
msgstr "Replace with: `Ge`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:56
#: 7814d7c5c86a46fab66b809c127663d2
msgid "替换用量：原子百分比 `3–8%`"
msgstr "Replacement amount: atomic percentage `3–8%`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:57
#: c587395d09ee4bcd87c4290c45bf068a
msgid "每个输入的输出数：`20`"
msgstr "Outputs per input: `20`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:59
#: cb6ad7ab90bc48b78f44836be4eeb727
msgid ""
"界面预览会显示该输入有 64 个候选位点，整数替换范围为 1–5。运行后检查 `random_doping` metadata "
"中的实际替换数和元素计数，再用独立的掺杂结构验证集比较加入这些样本前后的能量、力误差。卡片只改变元素，原子坐标、晶胞和 PBC 保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"The preview shows 64 candidate sites and an integer replacement range of "
"1–5 for this input. After running, inspect the realized replacement and "
"element counts in `random_doping` metadata, then compare energy and force"
" errors before and after adding these samples on an independent doped-"
"structure validation set. The card changes only elements; atomic "
"coordinates, the cell, and PBC remain unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:61
#: fcca487c82ac4a0d8748644f7328d66e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:63
#: d04f71b68bb946e2b5b8a25bd90439c1
msgid "规则（rules）"
msgstr "rules"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:65
#: 9bf250e8c3624a0bbec794e3c260ba2e
msgid "`list[dict[str, Any]]`，默认空列表，但运行至少需要一条完整规则。每条规则包含："
msgstr ""
"`list[dict[str, Any]]`, an empty list by default, but at least one "
"complete rule is required to run. Each rule contains:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:67
#: 0d065464ac56491ea3c57948fd2a7e44
msgid "`target`：被替换的元素；"
msgstr "`target`: the element to replace;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:68
#: a508c225bbfe44df8f2608dafdb7ce19
msgid "`dopants`：掺杂元素及相对权重，例如 `Ge:0.7,C:0.3`；"
msgstr ""
"`dopants`: dopant elements and relative weights, for example "
"`Ge:0.7,C:0.3`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:69
#: 4eb4732ca46e4970974cfee3fc10c6a2
msgid "`ratio_type`：`atom` 或 `mass`，表示 `dopants` 权重的基准；"
msgstr ""
"`ratio_type`: `atom` or `mass`, defining the basis of the `dopants` "
"weights;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:70
#: eef9191316704a5e8ce0944e300e5dd9
msgid "`use`：`atomic_percent`、`mass_percent` 或 `count`；"
msgstr "`use`: `atomic_percent`, `mass_percent`, or `count`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:71
#: 9858030a74b642648eee97cd675b3687
msgid "`percent`：百分比的最小值和最大值；"
msgstr "`percent`: minimum and maximum percentage;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:72
#: dd937445220a4c348a79e1db0a5c4314
msgid "`count`：原子数的最小值和最大值；"
msgstr "`count`: minimum and maximum atom count;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:73
#: 3361667f42ea42da858ead940fd7554c
msgid "`count_mode`：`fixed` 或 `random`；"
msgstr "`count_mode`: `fixed` or `random`;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:74
#: 24fb2fb909ab4b0b9feba55ddbbf7183
msgid "`group`：可选的 group 标签列表。"
msgstr "`group`: optional list of group labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:76
#: 6c9c44607aaf40689ac529b585b94dc7
msgid ""
"固定数量要求 `count` 的两端相同；随机数量在闭区间内抽取整数。填写 group 后，输入必须包含 "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` "
"且至少有一个对应目标元素命中。范围上界超过可用位点、规则重叠可能耗尽后续候选时，会在随机采样前确定性报错。"
msgstr ""
"A fixed count requires identical endpoints in `count`; a random count "
"draws an integer from the closed interval. When a group is supplied, the "
"input must contain `atoms.arrays[\"group\"]` and at least one target "
"element must match. If a range upper bound exceeds the available sites, "
"or overlapping rules can exhaust candidates needed later, a deterministic"
" error is reported before random sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:78
#: b968a6c4bbb2442ab891559482cc62a2
msgid "掺杂元素分配（doping_type）"
msgstr "Dopant Allocation (doping_type)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:80
#: b49ccfdf4b1f4fa0a6384a578e02d6b4
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Random`。`Random` 独立抽样各掺杂元素；`Exact` "
"用最大余数法固定每种掺杂元素的整数计数。二者都随机选择具体被替换位点。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Random`. `Random` samples each dopant independently; "
"`Exact` fixes integer counts for every dopant using the largest-remainder"
" method. Both choose the concrete replacement sites randomly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:82
#: 13df3dd9583c433dbd52a0b38b3e67a3
msgid "每个输入的输出数（max_structures）"
msgstr "Outputs per Input (max_structures)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:84
#: 53e234a8104847feb80e39c5759d3ac8
msgid "`int`，默认 1。参数名为兼容已有工作流保留，实际合同是严格数量：每个合法输入生成恰好该数量的输出，不是“最多”。总输出数为"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1. The parameter name is retained for workflow "
"compatibility, but its actual contract is an exact count: every valid "
"input produces precisely this many outputs, not `at most` this many. The "
"total output count is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:86
#: 0fae3aba03c9434f98638272723f4208
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=N_\\mathrm{input}\\times\\mathrm{max\\_structures}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:90
#: 293d0e85676a469692b44c85a920db1d
msgid "各输出独立抽样，允许得到相同替换数或相同落点，不做去重。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs are sampled independently and may have the same replacement count"
" or sites; no deduplication is performed."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:92
#: 327fcd03c0e540e992c34a263c48c00f
msgid "使用固定随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Fixed Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:94
#: 528be14837f54f679ff0b81af1191fb1
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。开启后使用可复现的样本级派生种子。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, a reproducible sample-level derived "
"seed is used."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:96
#: a82ef9f238f5411680c0a09a4c7722fa
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:98
#: da314387b1614638934da99e008c242e
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 0，无单位，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。派生种子结合基础 seed、输入 `Config_type` 的稳定 "
"ID 和样本序号；相同输入、参数和 seed 可复现。不同输入若 `Config_type` 也完全相同，仍可能复用相同随机路径。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 0, dimensionless and used only when `use_seed=true`. The "
"derived seed combines the base seed, a stable ID of the input "
"`Config_type`, and the sample index. Identical inputs, parameters, and "
"seeds are reproducible. Different inputs whose `Config_type` values are "
"also identical may still reuse the same random path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:100
#: 4489a48ba005460b9862168b060efaf7
msgid "推荐配置"
msgstr "Recommended Configuration"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:102
#: 1965900a71734d1c9b33707e805010f5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomDopingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"rules\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"target\": \"Si\",\n"
"        \"dopants\": {\"Ge\": 0.7, \"C\": 0.3},\n"
"        \"ratio_type\": \"atom\",\n"
"        \"use\": \"atomic_percent\",\n"
"        \"percent\": [3, 8],\n"
"        \"count\": [1, 1],\n"
"        \"count_mode\": \"fixed\",\n"
"        \"group\": []\n"
"      }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"doping_type\": \"Exact\",\n"
"    \"max_structures\": 20,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 101\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:127
#: e4d0fa40b96d419faf643ac2ea49f87d
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:129
#: caf74dba2f6f4cf49e2a698f3f69bc8e
msgid "**为什么提示无法替换任何原子？** 候选位点数乘以百分比后会向下取整。检查界面预览的整数范围；若最大值仍为 0，请提高用量或先扩大结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the card report that no atoms can be replaced?** Candidate-"
"site count multiplied by the percentage is rounded down. Inspect the "
"integer range in the preview; if its maximum is still zero, increase the "
"amount or enlarge the structure first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:131
#: 451f7fa79ab944b6b428920cbbddd1b8
msgid "**为什么选择固定配比后，替换总数仍会变化？** 固定配比只固定多种掺杂元素之间的整数分配。替换总数仍由每条规则的百分比或随机数量范围决定。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the total replacement count still vary after selecting an "
"exact ratio?** Exact allocation fixes only the integer distribution among"
" multiple dopant elements. The total replacement count is still "
"determined by each rule's percentage or random count range."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:133
#: 13970e57e954428bb9f812a23868b9b2
msgid ""
"**为什么 group 规则没有运行？** 输入必须包含 "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`，标签拼写必须匹配，而且对应分组中必须存在被替换元素。"
msgstr ""
"**Why did the group rule not run?** The input must contain "
"`atoms.arrays[\"group\"]`, label spelling must match, and the target "
"element must exist in the corresponding group."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:135
#: ae64e8484b72468e9c2ac051df9fc4b9
msgid "输出与迁移说明"
msgstr "Output and Migration Notes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:137
#: 2b36447241fa476496fe608d243820a7
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 `Dop(n=...)`。`atoms.info[\"random_doping\"]` 是 JSON "
"字符串，记录分配模式、样本序号、实际派生 seed、总替换数，以及每条规则的候选位点数、实际替换数和实际掺杂元素计数。"
msgstr ""
"`Dop(n=...)` is appended to `Config_type`. "
"`atoms.info[\"random_doping\"]` is a JSON string recording the allocation"
" mode, sample index, actual derived seed, total replacement count, and "
"for each rule its candidate-site count, realized replacement count, and "
"realized dopant-element counts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:139
#: bdbbf45f3a6a4183b20002ca3641ed16
msgid ""
"只要元素实际改变，原有 calculator、能量、力、应力、virial、磁矩、spin、charges "
"等物种相关参考标签会被清除；坐标、晶胞、PBC、group 和普通来源信息保留。"
msgstr ""
"Whenever elements actually change, species-dependent reference data such "
"as the calculator, energy, forces, stress, virial, magnetic moments, "
"spin, and charges are cleared. Coordinates, the cell, PBC, group, and "
"ordinary provenance information are retained."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:141
#: 4dbec7d22d5c499386e70f5005dfc076
msgid ""
"本次调整保留旧 JSON 字段和值，但有三项有意变化：空规则和确定无替换效果的规则不再返回未改变结构；固定 seed "
"的旧随机序列会因样本级派生方式而改变；随机范围合法抽到 0 时仍会显式写入 `Dop(n=0)` 和 metadata，便于识别该端点。"
msgstr ""
"This revision preserves legacy JSON fields and values but intentionally "
"changes three behaviors: empty rules and rules guaranteed to make no "
"replacements no longer return an unchanged structure; legacy fixed-seed "
"random sequences change because of sample-level derivation; and a valid "
"random range that draws zero still writes `Dop(n=0)` and metadata "
"explicitly so that endpoint can be identified."

